as game administrator you could easily nuke the bones file.  any normal
character can do the same from within the game by going to level 4 for
1 move and hopefully drawing in the bones file (that's a 1 in 3 chance)
and then going back up to level 3 and quitting.  end of ghost!  it may
be better to verify that you have the bones file before quitting (i.e
see a ghost first).  archeologists are good at this, sort of ...

